sequenceDiagram
    participant UI
    participant API as Evaluation API
    participant W as Worker
    participant DS as Data store
    participant RT as Retrieval service
    UI->>API: Request retrieval run {dataset, search config}
    API->>API: Create run + snapshot config & index
    API-->>UI: Accepted {run ID}
    W->>W: Wait for a global queue slot — pending · 60s heartbeat
    W->>DS: Dataset integrity check (gold passages exist?)
    W->>W: Pre-create every result row (excluded ones too) — the input snapshot is all that follows
    loop Per row (enabled only)
        alt All gold passages lost
            W->>W: Skip call — classified not judgeable
        else No gold specified
            W->>W: Skip call — classified not comparable
        else
            W->>RT: Search query {index, question, method, topK}
            RT-->>W: Documents (array order = ranking)
            opt When rerank is configured
                W->>RT: Rerank {model, query, top documents}
                RT-->>W: Reordered results (score desc)
                W->>W: Reorder the top, keep the rest in original order
            end
            W->>W: Compare against gold → store retrieval block
        end
        W->>W: progress +1
    end
    W->>W: Retrieval stage done · summary finalized
    UI->>API: Poll run status (progress)
